                        "glosses": [
                            "Outside or beyond what is normal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86c8f3c6-a918-4d51-9610-47bd03ab9f82",
                                "sense_id": "52ec497c-7fd7-3013-92d3-b3a38e38e74d",
                                "text": "The words \"Coroner's Inquest\" arrived in his mind, and disturbed it greatly. Those damned doctors would be peeking at that old corpse, exercising their ingenuity to explain that a thump on the skull had jerked life out of it. An extra-normal thump, too; damme, he had seen her hurtle through the air like a wet sack."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7d2f1384-2851-42fd-a7eb-37d822b64c22",
                                "sense_id": "52ec497c-7fd7-3013-92d3-b3a38e38e74d",
                                "text": "It seems that ghosts and legendary encounters in general thrive under the protection of law because their extranormal statements and implications require proof and provoke the less convincing counterproof."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e72bb2c5-11b4-458b-a1d5-eb081dde65ae",
                                "sense_id": "52ec497c-7fd7-3013-92d3-b3a38e38e74d",
                                "text": "Alex Danvers: The seismic activity [isn't] coming from within the planet, it's coming from without.\nSupergirl: That's...\nBrainiac: Extranormal?\nSupergirl: I was gonna say impossible, but OK."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
